   "badQuotes": [
    {
     "quote": "A potential customer has asked for SOC reports and my gut instinct is to simply say no deal.",
     "cites": [
      "src:1"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=25808608",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "Every time I've been asked about SOC compliance, it turned out the underlying reason was either insurance or a requirement the customer had",
     "cites": [
      "src:3"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48145797",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "certification is about sales.",
     "cites": [
      "src:9"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=25809370",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "at the end of the day it's a huge pain grabbing screenshots for what feels like a very performative process.",
     "cites": [
      "src:12"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49172683",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "Oftentimes evidence is screenshots of the running environment (vomit) or audit logs.",
     "cites": [
      "src:13"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48492685",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "That evidence needs to be versioned (auditors love asking 'show me this policy as it existed 6 months ago')",
     "cites": [
      "src:24"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46729951",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "something goes from being done in 2 hours to taking 3+ days.",
     "cites": [
      "src:14"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=32018066",
     "why": "part of the quote is on the page, part is not"
    },
    {
     "quote": "your audit compliance software (something like Vanta.com) is going to be setup to mandate every CVE",
     "cites": [
      "src:32"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49155789",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "customer just told you to turn around in 2 days",
     "cites": [
      "src:38"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=42787454",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "Having to fill endless security questionnaire without being sure you can even sell",
     "cites": [
      "src:37"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=42673560",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "it probably won't be cost-effective for most vendors to gather and collate this documentation",
     "cites": [
      "src:11"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=25795029",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "They run anywhere from $250-$4500 each. The main problem is that there has become a race to longer questionnaires",
     "cites": [
      "src:34"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=25793230",
     "why": "part of the quote is on the page, part is not"
    },
    {
     "quote": "That evidence needs to be versioned (auditors love asking 'show me this policy as it existed 6 months ago')",
     "cites": [
      "src:24"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46729951",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "Vanta made SOC2 way more intimidating than it was.",
     "cites": [
      "src:21"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=43353299",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "Vanta will ask (suggest? come perilously close to demand?) you do a lot of engineering work that is absolutely not necessary for a SOC2 attestation.",
     "cites": [
      "src:18"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48150981",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "Most startups should be doing way, way less than automation platforms like these tell them they need to do",
     "cites": [
      "src:20"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47461687",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "If Vanta has you set up some cloud detection capability, and it turns out as you mature your security organization that it wasn't necessary or even useful, you ",
     "cites": [
      "src:19"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48150981",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "once you do, then it gets set in stone and that's what you are audited against",
     "cites": [
      "src:31"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=44362665",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "It's incredibly easy to get SOC 2 audited and still have terrible security.",
     "cites": [
      "src:22"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=47612964",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "my whole company had a great laugh when a client required us to have a Pandemic Policy in 2019",
     "cites": [
      "src:33"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=25811616",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "The ROI is not even close to making sense. This looks like a huge PITA besides being expensive and requiring yearly investment.",
     "cites": [
      "src:2"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=25808608",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "It costs $40k in year one and $30k/year in subsequent years",
     "cites": [
      "src:10"
     ],
     "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=25810851",
     "why": "the page could not be read"
    },
    {
     "quote": "having experts that have done this before set you up for success in your $50k, year-long investment",
